# Cloudflare Pages redirect map for the WordPress -> Astro cutover.
#
# Without this file every unmatched path was being served the homepage with a
# 200, which turns ~104 old URLs into duplicate content instead of honest
# redirects. Splat rules count against the 100 dynamic-rule limit; the suburb
# pages are collapsed into one rule rather than listed individually.
#
# Decision (2026-08-17): the ~100 suburb pages produced roughly 2 clicks per
# quarter between them and sat at position 37-63. They are redirected to the
# homepage rather than rebuilt. See SEO-BASELINE.md.

# --- Suburb pages -> homepage -------------------------------------------
/computer-repairs-*              /            301

# --- Old WordPress pages that have an Astro equivalent -------------------
/about-us                        /about/      301
/about-us/                       /about/      301
/contact-us                      /contact/    301
/contact-us/                     /contact/    301

